---
<BaseLayout lang="uz">
  <div class="joy-wrap">
    <header class="joy-nav"><a href="/uz/" class="joy-logo">JoyJoy</a><nav class="joy-languages" aria-label="Languages"><a href="/" >RU</a><a href="/uz/" aria-current="page">UZ</a><a href="/en/" >EN</a></nav></header>
    <main><section class="joy-hero"><div class="joy-kicker">Yangi loyiha</div><h1>JoyJoy</h1><p>Yangi g‘oyalar uchun makon.</p></section><section class="joy-info joy-rule" id="about"><h2>Loyiha haqida</h2><p>JoyJoy — yangi loyiha. Uning imkoniyatlari, jamoasi va aloqa ma’lumotlari tasdiqlangach qo‘shiladi.</p></section></main>
    <footer class="joy-footer"><span>JoyJoy</span><span>© {new Date().getFullYear()}</span></footer>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>
